<title>UK: EIB sets 100 mln mark 10-year structured bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 100 mln mark 10-year structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN MARK  COUPON    *8.0 PCT   MATURITY    14.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.125   PAY DATE    14.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	*YEARS ONE TO FOUR THEN 16.0 PCT LESS TWO TIMES 6ML</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX/FFT   GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
